        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Sawyer International Airport, Brainerd, Marquette County, Crow Wing County, Michigan, Minnesota, K.I. Sawyer AFB, Sands Plains area\n- Products: M-553\n- Organizations: US Air Force\n- Topics: Airport identifiers, road access\n\nFacts:\n- Sawyer International Airport has IATA code MQT, ICAO code KSAW, and FAA LID SAW.\n- Sawyer International Airport is a county-owned public-use airport in Marquette County, Michigan, United States.\n- Brainerd Lakes Regional Airport has IATA code BRD, ICAO code KBRD, and FAA LID BRD.\n- Brainerd Lakes Regional Airport is a public-use airport located three nautical miles northeast of Brainerd in Crow Wing County, Minnesota, United States.\n- M-553 connects Marquette with Sawyer International Airport at the unincorporated community of K.I. Sawyer AFB in the Sands Plains area of Marquette County.\n- K.I. Sawyer AFB is the former site of a US Air Force base.\n- The base area's parking lot at Marquette Mountain is adjacent to highway M-553.",
